                                "sense_id": "e145850e-a01d-3713-a5a6-1e05186492f2",
                                "text": "Alaudinov's framing of himself, and by extension of the Chechen forces under his command, as a capable defensive body is also dissonant with the widespread perception of the efficacy of Chechen forces within the wider Russian information space."
                            }
                        ]
